{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step into the shadows of Prohibition. </strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The year is 1923. Alcohol is illegal, but business keeps flowing. Behind closed doors, barrels of illicit liquor are crafted, and the law is always watching. It?s time to build your own underground operation.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Speakeasy Simulator</strong>, you?ll manage every detail of your secret bar and distillery. Your goal is simple: produce, sell, and expand while staying one step ahead of the police.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Produce &amp; Distill Alcohol </strong><br> Transform fruits, vegetables, cereals, and other ingredients into fine illegal spirits. Control the quantity, quality, and production flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/c8802760c3991f8f827c5d909eaf791b.poster.avif?t=1768496442\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/c8802760c3991f8f827c5d909eaf791b.webm?t=1768496442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/c8802760c3991f8f827c5d909eaf791b.mp4?t=1768496442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design Your Bar &amp; Laboratory </strong><br> Arrange your speakeasy and distillery to optimize production, storage, and service. A well-organized space means smoother operations and happier customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/78c1f05e54b58113034cb7599e93d624.poster.avif?t=1768496442\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/78c1f05e54b58113034cb7599e93d624.webm?t=1768496442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/78c1f05e54b58113034cb7599e93d624.mp4?t=1768496442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell Your Products</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In bulk to the mafia</strong> for fast cash. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Per glass in your bar</strong> to satisfy the local clientele and earn more money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/a2f4e641ee76da0591050ea2e5692abe.poster.avif?t=1768496442\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/a2f4e641ee76da0591050ea2e5692abe.webm?t=1768496442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/a2f4e641ee76da0591050ea2e5692abe.mp4?t=1768496442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bar Decoration &amp; Customization</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add furniture, lights, trim, decorative elements as well as wall, floor and ceiling appearances to personalize your bar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new customization options by gaining <strong>reputation with your customers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/c4a1cfb751d82063ec46e0859c56c043.poster.avif?t=1768496442\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/c4a1cfb751d82063ec46e0859c56c043.webm?t=1768496442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/c4a1cfb751d82063ec46e0859c56c043.mp4?t=1768496442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customer Demands Matter </strong><br> Each visitor has specific expectations (type of alcohol, quantity, and quality). Meeting their needs builds reputation and profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/e63e6dce3f813ce7f990a6daeaecaac4.poster.avif?t=1768496442\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/e63e6dce3f813ce7f990a6daeaecaac4.webm?t=1768496442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/e63e6dce3f813ce7f990a6daeaecaac4.mp4?t=1768496442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evade Police Patrols </strong><br> Be careful of police patrols outside, especially at night, and try to avoid them while smuggling contraband to your local reseller.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883070/extras/0b8ffa57a23d4a7a3908c9d2e2cb773d.poster.avif?t=1768496442\" width=1170 height=658 ><source sr